# UDesign Design System Agent Rules (Cursor)

This workspace contains the canonical design system specification for the UDesign brand. All AI coding agents making edits to user interface layouts, stylesheets, or styling configurations in this project (or downstream repositories) MUST follow these instructions.

Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first: the six design rules, the accent budget, and how to pick a profile. Read [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) second, for the token vocabulary, component rules, and the one numbered banned-patterns list. Do not restate either file's rules here.

Before claiming any styling change is ready for review, run:

```bash
node scripts/lint-design.mjs
npm run build
```

Resolve every error before claiming completion.
